  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 299f02cab8b437643be53cf2058c1adf, type: 3}
  m_Name: Hell Dive
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  projectName: Hell Dive
  description: "Hell Dive is a first-person horror game where you are a Maritime
    Operative alone aboard a submarine. Sent on a mission to revive an abandoned
    deep-sea colony, you uncover dark secrets as terrifying and deadly horrors await
    in its depths.\n\nI joined the post-release phase tasked with overhauling the
    audio implementation \u2014 resolving clipping, timing, compression, and consistency
    issues to bring the mix up to a professional standard. \n\nBeyond the technical
    cleanup, my background in horror led to additional work designing and implementing
    new audio events and improving existing ones to better serve the game's tension
    and pacing."
  addText: 
